{
  "format": 1,
  "title": "Toggles and Show When",
  "summary": "Make a toggle that switches an arm between IK and FK, and buttons that show only in the mode they work in.",
  "order": 6,
  "practice": "../_scenes/arm_forearm.blend",
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "Step 1: Add a Toggle",
      "text": [
        "1. In the Kneady tab, click Forearm in the tree.",
        "2. Press + to add a button. Name it FK: Ctrl+click its name, type FK and press Enter.",
        "3. In its settings, click Toggle.",
        "",
        "This arm is rigged with Rigify. Its Forearm region has two buttons: Bend turns the forearm in FK, Reach moves the hand in IK. The arm starts in IK, so only Reach works yet."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "01_add.mp4",
          "label": "In the Kneady tab",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "highlight": [
        "objects[\"Arm\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[2].action"
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Arm\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[2].name",
          "is": "FK"
        },
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Arm\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[2].action",
          "is": "TOGGLE"
        }
      ],
      "start": {
        "mode": "OBJECT",
        "select": [
          "Arm"
        ],
        "active": "Arm",
        "sidebar": "Kneady",
        "view": {
          "location": [
            0.0,
            0.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "rotation": [
            0.71238,
            0.44106,
            0.28736,
            0.46412
          ],
          "distance": 2.4,
          "perspective": "PERSP"
        },
        "set": [
          {
            "path": "scene.kneady_on",
            "value": true
          },
          {
            "path": "objects[\"Arm\"].kneady.regions[0].tree_open",
            "value": false
          },
          {
            "path": "window_manager.kneady_row",
            "value": -1
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 2: Point It at the Switch",
      "text": [
        "1. Under Click Switches, click the arrow beside the Path field to open its command.",
        "2. Turn off Deform Hovered Object. Click Target, type Rig and press Enter.",
        "3. Click the Path field, type IK_FK, and click IK_FK in the list.",
        "",
        "IK_FK is Rigify's switch for this arm: 1 is FK, 0 is IK. A toggle sets it to 1 when it's on, 0 when it's off."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "02_switch.mp4",
          "label": "In the Kneady tab",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "highlight": [
        "objects[\"Arm\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[2].switch.target",
        "objects[\"Arm\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[2].switch.data_path"
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Arm\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[2].switch.target",
          "is": "Rig"
        },
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Arm\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[2].switch.data_path",
          "is": "pose.bones[\"upper_arm_parent.L\"][\"IK_FK\"]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 3: Switch It",
      "text": [
        "1. Hover the forearm and click FK: the arm switches to FK, and FK lights up.",
        "2. Click it again: back to IK."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "03_click.mp4",
          "label": "In the viewport",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "operator": "kneady.drag",
          "with": {
            "target": "Arm",
            "region": 1,
            "button": 2
          },
          "moved": false
        }
      ],
      "start": {
        "view": {
          "location": [
            0.0,
            0.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "rotation": [
            0.71238,
            0.44106,
            0.28736,
            0.46412
          ],
          "distance": 2.4,
          "perspective": "PERSP"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 4: Bend in FK Only",
      "text": [
        "1. Click Bend in the tree.",
        "2. Set Show to While On.",
        "3. Click the field beside it, type FK and click FK in the list.",
        "",
        "Bend now shows only while FK is on."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "04_bend_on.mp4",
          "label": "In the Kneady tab",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "highlight": [
        "objects[\"Arm\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].show_when",
        "objects[\"Arm\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].when_toggle"
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Arm\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].show_when",
          "is": "ON"
        },
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Arm\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].when_toggle",
          "is": "FK"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 5: Reach in IK Only",
      "text": [
        "1. Click Reach in the tree.",
        "2. Set Show to While Off. Click the field beside it, type FK and click FK in the list.",
        "",
        "Reach now shows only while FK is off: in IK."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "05_reach_off.mp4",
          "label": "In the Kneady tab",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "highlight": [
        "objects[\"Arm\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[1].show_when",
        "objects[\"Arm\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[1].when_toggle"
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Arm\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[1].show_when",
          "is": "OFF"
        },
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Arm\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[1].when_toggle",
          "is": "FK"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 6: Try It",
      "text": [
        "1. Hover the forearm: Reach shows. Drag it: the hand moves, the arm following.",
        "2. Click FK: Bend shows in Reach's place. Drag it up: the elbow bends.",
        "",
        "One region, two sets of controls, each showing when it works."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "06_try.mp4",
          "label": "In the viewport",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "operator": "kneady.drag",
          "with": {
            "target": "Arm",
            "region": 1,
            "button": 1
          },
          "moved": true
        },
        {
          "operator": "kneady.drag",
          "with": {
            "target": "Arm",
            "region": 1,
            "button": 0
          },
          "moved": true
        }
      ],
      "start": {
        "view": {
          "location": [
            0.0,
            0.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "rotation": [
            0.71238,
            0.44106,
            0.28736,
            0.46412
          ],
          "distance": 2.4,
          "perspective": "PERSP"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
